<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
<Document>
  <name>蒙古大迂回全程路线（1253-1259）</name>
  <description>上半场三路三色：东路红、中路绿、西路蓝；下半场统一橙色。坐标为现代地名大致对应，仅用于讲故事摆镜头，非考古精确位置。</description>

  <Style id="eastStyle">
    <LineStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle>
    <PolyStyle><fill>0</fill></PolyStyle>
  </Style>
  <Style id="midStyle">
    <LineStyle><color>ff00ff00</color><width>4</width></LineStyle>
    <PolyStyle><fill>0</fill></PolyStyle>
  </Style>
  <Style id="westStyle">
    <LineStyle><color>ffff0000</color><width>4</width></LineStyle>
    <PolyStyle><fill>0</fill></PolyStyle>
  </Style>
  <Style id="southStyle">
    <LineStyle><color>ff0080ff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle>
    <PolyStyle><fill>0</fill></PolyStyle>
  </Style>

  <Placemark>
    <name>上半场-东路牵制（抄合、也只烈）</name>
    <description>1253年8-12月：达拉沟→黄胜关→松潘→都江堰西缘→雅安→西昌→攀枝花→姚安→大理。走最好走的路，负责吸引南宋火力。</description>
    <styleUrl>#eastStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      103.50,34.00,0
      103.70,32.88,0
      103.60,32.65,0
      103.62,30.99,0
      103.04,29.98,0
      102.26,27.88,0
      101.71,26.58,0
      101.23,25.50,0
      100.16,25.69,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>上半场-中路主力（忽必烈）</name>
    <description>1253年8-12月：达拉沟→若尔盖→红原→马尔康→金川→丹巴→康定→泸定→汉源渡大渡河→西昌→盐源→宁蒗→大理。1253年12月进云南。</description>
    <styleUrl>#midStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      103.50,34.00,0
      102.95,33.57,0
      102.54,32.79,0
      102.22,31.90,0
      102.06,31.47,0
      102.18,30.87,0
      101.96,30.05,0
      102.23,29.91,0
      102.65,29.34,0
      102.26,27.88,0
      101.51,27.42,0
      100.85,27.28,0
      100.16,25.69,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>上半场-西路大迂回（兀良合台）</name>
    <description>1253年8-12月：达拉沟→阿坝→壤塘→炉霍→新龙→理塘→乡城→香格里拉→丽江→大理北门。绕得最远。</description>
    <styleUrl>#westStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      103.50,34.00,0
      101.68,32.90,0
      100.97,32.26,0
      100.67,31.39,0
      100.31,30.94,0
      100.27,30.01,0
      99.90,28.93,0
      99.70,27.82,0
      100.23,26.88,0
      100.10,25.90,0
      100.16,25.69,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>下半场-四川北线1-金牛道（蒙哥）</name>
    <description>1258-1259年：蒙哥主力走金牛道，陕西汉中→广元→剑阁→合川钓鱼城。蒙哥死在钓鱼城下，全军北返。</description>
    <styleUrl>#southStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      107.02,33.07,0
      105.84,32.43,0
      105.57,32.28,0
      106.28,30.01,0
      106.36,29.96,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>下半场-四川北线2-米仓道（蒙哥分兵）</name>
    <description>1258-1259年：分兵一路翻米仓山，汉中→南江→巴中→渠县→合州，与金牛道一路会师钓鱼城下。</description>
    <styleUrl>#southStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      107.02,33.07,0
      106.84,32.35,0
      106.75,31.87,0
      106.97,30.84,0
      106.28,30.01,0
      106.36,29.96,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>下半场-四川南线（云南北上）</name>
    <description>1258-1259年：云南→宜宾→泸州→重庆→合州，与北线在钓鱼城会合，顺江夺船直趋重庆。</description>
    <styleUrl>#southStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      102.71,25.04,0
      104.64,28.75,0
      105.42,28.87,0
      106.55,29.56,0
      106.36,29.96,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>下半场-湖北北线（忽必烈、张柔）</name>
    <description>1258-1259年：渡淮河→扫平江淮→渡长江→围鄂州（武昌）。拿下长沙武汉就掌握湖南湖北。</description>
    <styleUrl>#southStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      117.39,32.91,0
      117.22,31.82,0
      114.30,30.55,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>下半场-湖南南线（兀良合台）</name>
    <description>1258-1259年：云南→南宁老苍关→桂林→怀化→长沙（潭州）。击溃宋军，围城月余，大小13战。</description>
    <styleUrl>#southStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      102.71,25.04,0
      108.36,22.81,0
      110.28,25.27,0
      110.00,27.57,0
      112.93,28.22,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>下半场-安南线（兀良合台1257-1258）</name>
    <description>1257年兀良合台以云南为基地顺红河而下攻安南，1258年安南国王请降称臣。安南未入直接管辖只是属国，蒙古获借道权。后陈兴道两次击败蒙古，越南独立。</description>
    <styleUrl>#southStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      102.71,25.04,0
      103.97,22.51,0
      105.85,21.02,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>安南-河内1258年请降称臣</name>
    <description>红河三角洲，安南中心。1258年国王请降，属国状态，蒙古获借道进攻南宋之权。后陈朝陈兴道两次击败蒙古。</description>
    <Point><coordinates>105.85,21.02,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>下半场-安徽牵制（塔察尔）</name>
    <description>1258-1259年：攻荆山怀远一带，不习水战，以牵制为主，让南宋分兵。</description>
    <styleUrl>#southStyle</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>
      116.50,33.50,0
      116.99,32.95,0
    </coordinates></LineString>
  </Placemark>

  <Placemark>
    <name>起点-临洮集结1253年8月</name>
    <description>忽必烈在此备粮、发纸币、派使者劝降大理未果，随后南下达拉沟。</description>
    <Point><coordinates>103.857,35.376,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>分兵点-达拉沟</name>
    <description>今甘肃迭部附近，白龙江上游小盆地，一分为三。</description>
    <Point><coordinates>103.50,34.00,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>中转-大理1253年12月</name>
    <description>中路、西路进云南，随后拿下大理，成为包抄南宋的跳板。</description>
    <Point><coordinates>100.16,25.69,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>湖南-长沙1259年围城</name>
    <description>潭州，兀良合台从广西北上，击溃二十万守军，围城月余。</description>
    <Point><coordinates>112.93,28.22,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>湖北-武昌1259年被围</name>
    <description>鄂州，忽必烈、张柔渡江围城，与南线夹击湖南湖北。</description>
    <Point><coordinates>114.30,30.55,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>结局-钓鱼城1259年8月蒙哥去世</name>
    <description>四川合川钓鱼城，大汗死在这里，全军北返争汗位，南宋多活20年。</description>
    <Point><coordinates>106.36,29.96,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>

</Document>
</kml>
